---
External dependencies (not bundled): every tool the README's Requirements tables name, from the four
hard requirements (git, rsync, jq, util-linux for flock) through the optional ones (gum, systemd, curl,
networkmanager, psmisc, python, xdg-terminal-exec, wl-clipboard, libnotify, github-cli) to the manifest
generators, ships with Omarchy or is an Arch package; none of them is bundled here. gum is optional:
without it the wizard's text prompts take their default and its yes/no gates answer no. gitleaks
(MIT, https://github.com/gitleaks/gitleaks) is optional too and gates pushes only.
